<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1428" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄδμ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδάματος</span>, in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> only in fem. and of cattle, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unbroken</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦν ἦνιν . . ἀδμήτην, ἣν οὔ πω
					ὑπὸ ζυγὸν ἤγαγεν ἀνήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.293
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.383
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππον . . ἑξέτε᾽ ἀδμήτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.266
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμίονον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				655
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unwedded</i>, of maidens, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρθένῳ ἀδμήτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ven.</u>
					82
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				133
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				149
			</span></i>; of Artemis, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν αἰὲν ἀδμήταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					1239
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); of Atalanta, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πρόσθεν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OC</u>
					1321
				</span></i>
			.</div>
